olor:rgb(197,6,11)\">  error: unable to load shared object &#39;/Users/dicook/Library/R/3.0/library/qtbase/libs/qtbase.so&#39;:\r\n</span><span style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">  dlopen(/Users/dicook/Library/R/3.0/library/qtbase/libs/qtbase.so, 6): Library not loaded: libQtCLucene.4.dylib\r\n</span><span style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">  Referenced from: /Library/Frameworks/QtHelp.framework/Versions/4/QtHelp\r\n</span><span style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">  Reason: image not found\r\n</span><span style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error: loading failed\r\n</span><span style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">Executi